            <description><![CDATA[<p>URL: <a href="https://deepmind.google/models/gemini/">https://deepmind.google/models/gemini/</a>, See on <a href="https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50073879">Hacker News</a></p>
<div id="readability-page-1" class="page"><div id="page-content"><section aria-label="Explore the latest" data-event-module-name="Explore the latest" aria-roledescription="carousel" id="explore" role="region"><p>Slide 1 of 4</p><div><div><p><h2>Solving frontier problems with experts</h2></p><p data-block-key="bss25">Researchers, engineers, and security specialists are pairing with Argon to push the boundaries of science, math, robotics and cyber defense.</p></div><div><p><h2>Unlocking new scientific breakthroughs</h2></p><p data-block-key="bss25">Argon is helping researchers at Google and the scientific community accelerate their path to discovery and real-world impact.</p></div><div><p><h2>Accelerating robotics</h2></p><p data-block-key="bss25">Argon autonomously turns raw video to a physics-accurate simulation, estimating depth and physical boundaries, and writing the exact simulation code required to replicate those real-world environments.</p></div><div><p><h2>Scaling cybersecurity defense responsibly</h2></p><p data-block-key="bss25">Argon ties for #1 on CWE-Bench (68%) for vulnerability remediation, is our most resilient model against indirect prompt injections, and is expanding to hundreds of additional Fairwind Program partners today.</p></div></div></section><div><ul data-jumplink-label="Jump to section within page"><li><a data-event-content-name="Hands-on" data-event-content-type="jumplinks" data-gtm-event="in_page_navigation" href="#hands-on"> Hands-on </a></li><li><a data-event-content-name="Performance" data-event-content-type="jumplinks" data-gtm-event="in_page_navigation" href="#performance"> Performance </a></li><li><a data-event-content-name="Safety" data-event-content-type="jumplinks" data-gtm-event="in_page_navigation" href="#safety"> Safety </a></li><li><a data-event-content-name="Try Gemini 4 Argon" data-event-content-type="jumplinks" data-gtm-event="in_page_navigation" href="#try-gemini-4-argon"> Try Gemini 4 Argon </a></li></ul></div><div id="solving-complex-engineering-tasks" aria-label="Tabbed content" role="tablist"><div aria-controls="panel-32bddd70-9121-46a4-a3df-9968f7de7cb3-0" aria-selected="true" data-index="0" data-tab-slug="0-untangling-browser-feature-code-in-chrome" id="tab-32bddd70-9121-46a4-a3df-9968f7de7cb3-0" role="tab" tabindex="0"><p><span>Untangling browser feature code in Chrome</span></p></div><div aria-controls="panel-32bddd70-9121-46a4-a3df-9968f7de7cb3-1" aria-selected="false" data-index="1" data-tab-slug="1-quantum-chemistry-open-source-package-optimization" id="tab-32bddd70-9121-46a4-a3df-9968f7de7cb3-1" role="tab" tabindex="0"><p><span>Quantum chemistry open-source package optimization</span></p></div><div aria-controls="panel-32bddd70-9121-46a4-a3df-9968f7de7cb3-2" aria-selected="false" data-index="2" data-tab-slug="2-optimizing-a-production-python-codebase-in-hours" id="tab-32bddd70-9121-46a4-a3df-9968f7de7cb3-2" role="tab" tabindex="0"><p><span>Optimizing a production Python codebase in hours</span></p></div><div aria-controls="panel-32bddd70-9121-46a4-a3df-9968f7de7cb3-3" aria-selected="false" data-index="3" data-tab-slug="3-making-our-open-gemma-models-nearly-three-times-as-fast" id="tab-32bddd70-9121-46a4-a3df-9968f7de7cb3-3" role="tab" tabindex="0"><p><span>Making our open Gemma models nearly three times as fast</span></p></div></div><div id="delivering-complex-3d-visualizations"><scroller-block>  </scroller-block><div><section aria-label="Card carousel" aria-roledescription="carousel" data-carousel-breakpoint="xl" id="card-group-carousel-019009d5-c10d-4cca-bfaa-81a8af919a0f" role="region"><p>Slide 1 of 5</p><div><div aria-label="1 of 5" aria-roledescription="slide" role="group"><article><div><figure><figure></figure><figcaption><deepai-caption><p data-block-key="3kvmi">Argon built a highly detailed model of a Pagoda using multi-agent visual critique loops in Antigravity. The model autonomously sculpted a multi-building temple complex with photorealistic architecture, foliage and lighting in Blender.</p></deepai-caption></figcaption></figure></div></article></div><div aria-label="2 of 5" aria-roledescription="slide" role="group"><article><div><figure><figure></figure><figcaption><deepai-caption><p data-block-key="3kvmi">Argon turned pictures of a real desk into a playable miniature racing game using a multi-agent loop in Antigravity. The desk objects, room and race track were modeled and collision-checked using Blender MCP, textured with Nano Banana, and wired with physics, custom shaders, and car engine audio from Gemini Omni Flash in Three.js.</p></deepai-caption></figcaption></figure></div></article></div><div aria-label="3 of 5" aria-roledescription="slide" role="group"><article><div><figure><figure></figure><figcaption><deepai-caption><p data-block-key="3kvmi">Argon in Antigravity wrote Python scripts to procedurally sculpt, rig, animate, and PBR-bake a complex 3D game using multi-agent visual critique loops then wired it for the web in Three.js with GLSL shaders, shatter physics, and a single-player AI.</p></deepai-caption></figcaption></figure></div></article></div><div aria-label="4 of 5" aria-roledescription="slide" role="group"><article><div><figure><figure></figure><figcaption><deepai-caption><p data-block-key="3kvmi">With zero external libraries and 100% pure Python, Argon wrote its own 3D ray-tracing engine with a custom video tool and audio mixer to build and document a sunlit library from scratch, producing, narrating, and assembling this video with Gemini 3.8 TTS voiceover and music by Lyria 3.5.</p></deepai-caption></figcaption></figure></div></article></div><div aria-label="5 of 5" aria-roledescription="slide" role="group"><article><div><figure><figure></figure><figcaption><deepai-caption><p data-block-key="3kvmi">Starting from a single Nano Banana image in Antigravity, Argon drives Blender MCP in an autonomous loop, aligning camera grids, sculpting Gothic architecture, and staging audio-reactive lighting, to create a finished 3D scene.</p></deepai-caption></figcaption></figure></div></article></div></div></section><div><div><article><div><figure><figure></figure><figcaption><deepai-caption><p data-block-key="3kvmi">Argon built a highly detailed model of a Pagoda using multi-agent visual critique loops in Antigravity. The model autonomously sculpted a multi-building temple complex with photorealistic architecture, foliage and lighting in Blender.</p></deepai-caption></figcaption></figure></div></article></div><div><article><div><figure><figure></figure><figcaption><deepai-caption><p data-block-key="3kvmi">Argon turned pictures of a real desk into a playable miniature racing game using a multi-agent loop in Antigravity. The desk objects, room and race track were modeled and collision-checked using Blender MCP, textured with Nano Banana, and wired with physics, custom shaders, and car engine audio from Gemini Omni Flash in Three.js.</p></deepai-caption></figcaption></figure></div></article></div><div><article><div><figure><figure></figure><figcaption><deepai-caption><p data-block-key="3kvmi">Argon in Antigravity wrote Python scripts to procedurally sculpt, rig, animate, and PBR-bake a complex 3D game using multi-agent visual critique loops then wired it for the web in Three.js with GLSL shaders, shatter physics, and a single-player AI.</p></deepai-caption></figcaption></figure></div></article></div><div><article><div><figure><figure></figure><figcaption><deepai-caption><p data-block-key="3kvmi">With zero external libraries and 100% pure Python, Argon wrote its own 3D ray-tracing engine with a custom video tool and audio mixer to build and document a sunlit library from scratch, producing, narrating, and assembling this video with Gemini 3.8 TTS voiceover and music by Lyria 3.5.</p></deepai-caption></figcaption></figure></div></article></div><div><article><div><figure><figure></figure><figcaption><deepai-caption><p data-block-key="3kvmi">Starting from a single Nano Banana image in Antigravity, Argon drives Blender MCP in an autonomous loop, aligning camera grids, sculpting Gothic architecture, and staging audio-reactive lighting, to create a finished 3D scene.</p></deepai-caption></figcaption></figure></div></article></div></div></div></div><div id="transforming-critical-business-and-professional-workflows"><scroller-block>  </scroller-block><div><figure><figcaption><deepai-caption><p data-block-key="1jkgo">At Isomorphic Labs, the team is using Argon as a partner to accelerate their drug discovery and design research workflows. Argon is able to quickly synthesize complex PDFs and patents to extract pertinent information, reducing a process that typically takes weeks into hours.</p></deepai-caption></figcaption></figure></div></div><div id="testimonials"><div id="tab-container-1f60b978-1748-44c8-89a3-b7aab3f8b1f3" aria-label="Tabbed content" role="tablist"><p><span>Ambience Healthcare</span></p><p><span>Amplitude</span></p><p><span>Axiom Bio</span></p><p><span>Box</span></p><p><span>Cartwheel</span></p><p><span>Deloitte</span></p><p><span>Kepler</span></p><p><span>LexisNexis</span></p><p><span>MinutalA</span></p><p><span>Quadrillon</span></p><p><span>Quora</span></p><p><span>Roboflow</span></p></div><div id="tabs__panels-1f60b978-1748-44c8-89a3-b7aab3f8b1f3"><div data-width="full" aria-labelledby="tab-1f60b978-1748-44c8-89a3-b7aab3f8b1f3-0" id="panel-1f60b978-1748-44c8-89a3-b7aab3f8b1f3-0" role="tabpanel"><abc-bridge> <figure data-hydration="client:idle"><div><blockquote><p>“On over 200 complex synthetic longitudinal charts, Gemini 4 achieved the highest recall and ICD-10 code specificity among the models we evaluated, producing concise problem lists without external lookups. That combination of medical knowledge and long-context understanding shows promise for clinician-reviewed chart workflows. We're now validating it on real patient records and excited to try it out more broadly.”</p></blockquote></div><figcaption> <div data-has-dark-logo=""><picture><img alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" height="360" loading="lazy" role="presentation" sizes="auto" src="https://storage.googleapis.com/gdm-deepmind-com-prod-public/media/images/6ObnSvQ19M4Yrj5v/showcase__ambience__light.width-1440.svg" width="360"></picture><picture><img alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" height="360" loading="lazy" role="presentation" sizes="auto" src="https://storage.googleapis.com/gdm-deepmind-com-prod-public/media/images/4CpOJc9xRK_rOJ0g/showcase__ambience__dark.width-1440.svg" width="360"></picture></div></figcaption></figure> </abc-bridge></div><div data-width="full" aria-labelledby="tab-1f60b978-1748-44c8-89a3-b7aab3f8b1f3-1" id="panel-1f60b978-1748-44c8-89a3-b7aab3f8b1f3-1" role="tabpanel"><abc-bridge> <figure data-hydration="client:idle"><div><blockquote><p>“Argon is doing a great job at understanding what people actually mean. Customers collect endless signals that they don't know what to do with. Argon consistently scored amongst the top in our evals for building charts that help visualize the solutions for customers. It's also meaningfully persistent about finding those kinds of needle in a haystack answers that are valuable to customers.”</p></blockquote></div><figcaption><div><p>Curtis Liu</p><p>CTO, Amplitude</p></div> <div data-has-dark-logo=""><picture><img alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" height="360" loading="lazy" role="presentation" sizes="auto" src="https://storage.googleapis.com/gdm-deepmind-com-prod-public/media/images/fJciDuCkMJEm3tMv/showcase__amplitude__light.width-1440.svg" width="360"></picture><picture><img alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" height="360" loading="lazy" role="presentation" sizes="auto" src="https://storage.googleapis.com/gdm-deepmind-com-prod-public/media/images/3sFPP5m9lqW7Zugf/showcase__amplitude__dark.width-1440.svg" width="360"></picture></div></figcaption></figure> </abc-bridge></div><div data-width="full" aria-labelledby="tab-1f60b978-1748-44c8-89a3-b7aab3f8b1f3-2" id="panel-1f60b978-1748-44c8-89a3-b7aab3f8b1f3-2" role="tabpanel"><abc-bridge> <figure data-hydration="client:idle"><div><blockquote><p>“Gemini 4 represents a step change in what AI can accomplish in real-world science. We've seen it reason through complex experimental data, from cellular imaging to mass spectrometry, and make subtle findings that traditionally require expert scientists to identify. On our Scientific Agent Benchmark, Gemini 4 was at the frontier across most tasks, including our hardest: ranking the clinical risk between two drugs.”</p></blockquote></div><figcaption><div><p>Alex Cabrera</p><p>Founding Engineer, Axiom Bio</p></div> <div data-has-dark-logo=""><picture><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Oyu9dzLeKfbn9DtOJhnqTBeD2htlEGbEWlA5dLnFxRqQnv3JgnCLiQpB5OE9XjHEjakJy5Q1Mp1IZAME667vjmpyQHuc_sSC4WrEg2-sI_BE6HY9rQ=w1440-rw-lo" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Oyu9dzLeKfbn9DtOJhnqTBeD2htlEGbEWlA5dLnFxRqQnv3JgnCLiQpB5OE9XjHEjakJy5Q1Mp1IZAME667vjmpyQHuc_sSC4WrEg2-sI_BE6HY9rQ=w393-rw-lo 360w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Oyu9dzLeKfbn9DtOJhnqTBeD2htlEGbEWlA5dLnFxRqQnv3JgnCLiQpB5OE9XjHEjakJy5Q1Mp1IZAME667vjmpyQHuc_sSC4WrEg2-sI_BE6HY9rQ=w480-rw-lo 360w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Oyu9dzLeKfbn9DtOJhnqTBeD2htlEGbEWlA5dLnFxRqQnv3JgnCLiQpB5OE9XjHEjakJy5Q1Mp1IZAME667vjmpyQHuc_sSC4WrEg2-sI_BE6HY9rQ=w640-rw-lo 360w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Oyu9dzLeKfbn9DtOJhnqTBeD2htlEGbEWlA5dLnFxRqQnv3JgnCLiQpB5OE9XjHEjakJy5Q1Mp1IZAME667vjmpyQHuc_sSC4WrEg2-sI_BE6HY9rQ=w768-rw-lo 360w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Oyu9dzLeKfbn9DtOJhnqTBeD2htlEGbEWlA5dLnFxRqQnv3JgnCLiQpB5OE9XjHEjakJy5Q1Mp1IZAME667vjmpyQHuc_sSC4WrEg2-sI_BE6HY9rQ=w1024-rw-lo 360w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Oyu9dzLeKfbn9DtOJhnqTBeD2htlEGbEWlA5dLnFxRqQnv3JgnCLiQpB5OE9XjHEjakJy5Q1Mp1IZAME667vjmpyQHuc_sSC4WrEg2-sI_BE6HY9rQ=w1440-rw-lo 360w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Oyu9dzLeKfbn9DtOJhnqTBeD2htlEGbEWlA5dLnFxRqQnv3JgnCLiQpB5OE9XjHEjakJy5Q1Mp1IZAME667vjmpyQHuc_sSC4WrEg2-sI_BE6HY9rQ=w1728-rw-lo 360w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Oyu9dzLeKfbn9DtOJhnqTBeD2htlEGbEWlA5dLnFxRqQnv3JgnCLiQpB5OE9XjHEjakJy5Q1Mp1IZAME667vjmpyQHuc_sSC4WrEg2-sI_BE6HY9rQ=w2880-rw-lo 360w" alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" height="360" loading="lazy" role="presentation" sizes="auto" width="360"></picture><picture><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/KlmhB-_SbB-WMVy78mR_fLzJ2z2_WnUuq5Sr8nc_H9IdxvyFOW-jt8zQHNNgKUNhwD6fhbFxNo0XxnwrHODdnYU2vE7w6TV2YhwaXradhxAfogPD7w=w1440-rw-lo" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/KlmhB-_SbB-WMVy78mR_fLzJ2z2_WnUuq5Sr8nc_H9IdxvyFOW-jt8zQHNNgKUNhwD6fhbFxNo0XxnwrHODdnYU2vE7w6TV2YhwaXradhxAfogPD7w=w393-rw-lo 360w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/KlmhB-_SbB-WMVy78mR_fLzJ2z2_WnUuq5Sr8nc_H9IdxvyFOW-jt8zQHNNgKUNhwD6fhbFxNo0XxnwrHODdnYU2vE7w6TV2YhwaXradhxAfogPD7w=w480-rw-lo 360w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/KlmhB-_SbB-WMVy78mR_fLzJ2z2_WnUuq5Sr8nc_H9IdxvyFOW-jt8zQHNNgKUNhwD6fhbFxNo0XxnwrHODdnYU2vE7w6TV2YhwaXradhxAfogPD7w=w640-rw-lo 360w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/KlmhB-_SbB-WMVy78mR_fLzJ2z2_WnUuq5Sr8nc_H9IdxvyFOW-jt8zQHNNgKUNhwD6fhbFxNo0XxnwrHODdnYU2vE7w6TV2YhwaXradhxAfogPD7w=w768-rw-lo 360w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/KlmhB-_SbB-WMVy78mR_fLzJ2z2_WnUuq5Sr8nc_H9IdxvyFOW-jt8zQHNNgKUNhwD6fhbFxNo0XxnwrHODdnYU2vE7w6TV2YhwaXradhxAfogPD7w=w1024-rw-lo 360w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/KlmhB-_SbB-WMVy78mR_fLzJ2z2_WnUuq5Sr8nc_H9IdxvyFOW-jt8zQHNNgKUNhwD6fhbFxNo0XxnwrHODdnYU2vE7w6TV2YhwaXradhxAfogPD7w=w1440-rw-lo 360w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/KlmhB-_SbB-WMVy78mR_fLzJ2z2_WnUuq5Sr8nc_H9IdxvyFOW-jt8zQHNNgKUNhwD6fhbFxNo0XxnwrHODdnYU2vE7w6TV2YhwaXradhxAfogPD7w=w1728-rw-lo 360w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/KlmhB-_SbB-WMVy78mR_fLzJ2z2_WnUuq5Sr8nc_H9IdxvyFOW-jt8zQHNNgKUNhwD6fhbFxNo0XxnwrHODdnYU2vE7w6TV2YhwaXradhxAfogPD7w=w2880-rw-lo 360w" alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" height="360" loading="lazy" role="presentation" sizes="auto" width="360"></picture></div></figcaption></figure> </abc-bridge></div><div data-width="full" aria-labelledby="tab-1f60b978-1748-44c8-89a3-b7aab3f8b1f3-3" id="panel-1f60b978-1748-44c8-89a3-b7aab3f8b1f3-3" role="tabpanel"><abc-bridge> <figure data-hydration="client:idle"><div><blockquote><p>“Gemini 4 Argon is at the frontier of enterprise knowledge work, achieving a 14% improvement in accuracy compared to Gemini 3.1 Pro. In Box’s evaluation, Argon connected evidence across the full set of documents, including details embedded in figures, and carried multi-step analyses through to complete answers. This is especially valuable in data analysis and in technical fields like healthcare and life sciences, where teams need to find and interpret information across many kinds of source material.”</p></blockquote></div><figcaption><div><p>Yashodha Bhavnani</p><p>VP of AI Products at Box</p></div> <div data-has-dark-logo=""><picture><img alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" height="360" loading="lazy" role="presentation" sizes="auto" src="https://storage.googleapis.com/gdm-deepmind-com-prod-public/media/images/cnWRMGASV3lTGpiz/showcase__box__light.width-1440.svg" width="360"></picture><picture><img alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" height="360" loading="lazy" role="presentation" sizes="auto" src="https://storage.googleapis.com/gdm-deepmind-com-prod-public/media/images/qorj9TfUgIRi0xYY/showcase__box__dark.width-1440.svg" width="360"></picture></div></figcaption></figure> </abc-bridge></div><div data-width="full" aria-labelledby="tab-1f60b978-1748-44c8-89a3-b7aab3f8b1f3-4" id="panel-1f60b978-1748-44c8-89a3-b7aab3f8b1f3-4" role="tabpanel"><abc-bridge> <figure data-hydration="client:idle"><div><blockquote><p>“By integrating Gemini 4 into our 3D spatial reconstruction engine, we turn everyday video into articulated, physics-ready 3D scenes in seconds instead of hours. Across our benchmarks, Gemini outperformed every model we tested — cutting runtime nearly 100× and token usage by 90%, unlocking physics ready and watertight 3D asset creation for our customers.”</p></blockquote></div><figcaption><div><p>Andrew Carr</p><p>Co-founder and Chief Scientist, Cartwheel</p></div> <div data-has-dark-logo=""><picture><img alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" height="360" loading="lazy" role="presentation" sizes="auto" src="https://storage.googleapis.com/gdm-deepmind-com-prod-public/media/images/cFtor7wyAVA-0Gwo/showcase__cartwheel__light.width-1440.svg" width="360"></picture><picture><img alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" height="360" loading="lazy" role="presentation" sizes="auto" src="https://storage.googleapis.com/gdm-deepmind-com-prod-public/media/images/Yk0OpVHMxrFchS6P/showcase__cartwheel__dark.width-1440.svg" width="360"></picture></div></figcaption></figure> </abc-bridge></div><div data-width="full" aria-labelledby="tab-1f60b978-1748-44c8-89a3-b7aab3f8b1f3-5" id="panel-1f60b978-1748-44c8-89a3-b7aab3f8b1f3-5" role="tabpanel"><abc-bridge> <figure data-hydration="client:idle"><div><blockquote><p>“Early impressions from Gemini 4 are very strong: for long-running tasks across these workflows, it completed successfully 100% of the time in our evals, maintaining context and running through multiple tools across impressive spans. Its depth of reasoning delivers significantly higher, clearer output. Performing in-depth reasoning for domain-specific tasks without detailed prior logic or instructions is something we’ve never seen with any model in its class before.”</p></blockquote></div><figcaption><div><p>Gopal Srinivasan</p><p>Global AI and Data Lead, Deloitte</p></div> <div data-has-dark-logo=""><picture><img alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" height="360" loading="lazy" role="presentation" sizes="auto" src="https://storage.googleapis.com/gdm-deepmind-com-prod-public/media/images/2lu6nQbyFZCfIwHT/showcase__deloitte__light.width-1440.svg" width="360"></picture><picture><img alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" height="360" loading="lazy" role="presentation" sizes="auto" src="https://storage.googleapis.com/gdm-deepmind-com-prod-public/media/images/ZgWtCiayGIGSSmuf/showcase__deloitte__dark.width-1440.svg" width="360"></picture></div></figcaption></figure> </abc-bridge></div><div data-width="full" aria-labelledby="tab-1f60b978-1748-44c8-89a3-b7aab3f8b1f3-6" id="panel-1f60b978-1748-44c8-89a3-b7aab3f8b1f3-6" role="tabpanel"><abc-bridge> <figure data-hydration="client:idle"><div><blockquote><p>“On our core financial analysis benchmarks, which span building multi-year financial statements straight from SEC filings to valuing companies with complex capital structures and announced acquisitions, Gemini 4 matched our analyst-built reference models on more than 99% of figures. Performance on our most complex workflows was at the frontier in a majority of tasks. We're excited to keep building with Gemini 4 at Kepler.”</p></blockquote></div><figcaption><div><p>Glenn LeBlanc</p><p>Software Engineer, Kepler</p></div> <div data-has-dark-logo=""><picture><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/4dv5jOV69ccTvpFoUnjeJUEFjz3ciYqo-k1wb0Q2hicNklGpMN_jfyGi2c8TcujToufyIn12YvCj5rkVCXFgPwtHVaYMKtC3q5PVToSjUeaKK0yx5w=w1440-rw-lo" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/4dv5jOV69ccTvpFoUnjeJUEFjz3ciYqo-k1wb0Q2hicNklGpMN_jfyGi2c8TcujToufyIn12YvCj5rkVCXFgPwtHVaYMKtC3q5PVToSjUeaKK0yx5w=w393-rw-lo 360w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/4dv5jOV69ccTvpFoUnjeJUEFjz3ciYqo-k1wb0Q2hicNklGpMN_jfyGi2c8TcujToufyIn12YvCj5rkVCXFgPwtHVaYMKtC3q5PVToSjUeaKK0yx5w=w480-rw-lo 360w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/4dv5jOV69ccTvpFoUnjeJUEFjz3ciYqo-k1wb0Q2hicNklGpMN_jfyGi2c8TcujToufyIn12YvCj5rkVCXFgPwtHVaYMKtC3q5PVToSjUeaKK0yx5w=w640-rw-lo 360w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/4dv5jOV69ccTvpFoUnjeJUEFjz3ciYqo-k1wb0Q2hicNklGpMN_jfyGi2c8TcujToufyIn12YvCj5rkVCXFgPwtHVaYMKtC3q5PVToSjUeaKK0yx5w=w768-rw-lo 360w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/4dv5jOV69ccTvpFoUnjeJUEFjz3ciYqo-k1wb0Q2hicNklGpMN_jfyGi2c8TcujToufyIn12YvCj5rkVCXFgPwtHVaYMKtC3q5PVToSjUeaKK0yx5w=w1024-rw-lo 360w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/4dv5jOV69ccTvpFoUnjeJUEFjz3ciYqo-k1wb0Q2hicNklGpMN_jfyGi2c8TcujToufyIn12YvCj5rkVCXFgPwtHVaYMKtC3q5PVToSjUeaKK0yx5w=w1440-rw-lo 360w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/4dv5jOV69ccTvpFoUnjeJUEFjz3ciYqo-k1wb0Q2hicNklGpMN_jfyGi2c8TcujToufyIn12YvCj5rkVCXFgPwtHVaYMKtC3q5PVToSjUeaKK0yx5w=w1728-rw-lo 360w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/4dv5jOV69ccTvpFoUnjeJUEFjz3ciYqo-k1wb0Q2hicNklGpMN_jfyGi2c8TcujToufyIn12YvCj5rkVCXFgPwtHVaYMKtC3q5PVToSjUeaKK0yx5w=w2880-rw-lo 360w" alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" height="360" loading="lazy" role="presentation" sizes="auto" width="360"></picture><picture><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Beeo_omw_Hsw1blQOJGc9GsA3skqougwqE64LQTT-7F0cvp_6A95y9O-WQ0AbZVfGAJYelJ2ZEnk14TD_pUIVZITE78ZLIVhKH7-wkkynTPBmYMlfg=w1440-rw-lo" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Beeo_omw_Hsw1blQOJGc9GsA3skqougwqE64LQTT-7F0cvp_6A95y9O-WQ0AbZVfGAJYelJ2ZEnk14TD_pUIVZITE78ZLIVhKH7-wkkynTPBmYMlfg=w393-rw-lo 360w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Beeo_omw_Hsw1blQOJGc9GsA3skqougwqE64LQTT-7F0cvp_6A95y9O-WQ0AbZVfGAJYelJ2ZEnk14TD_pUIVZITE78ZLIVhKH7-wkkynTPBmYMlfg=w480-rw-lo 360w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Beeo_omw_Hsw1blQOJGc9GsA3skqougwqE64LQTT-7F0cvp_6A95y9O-WQ0AbZVfGAJYelJ2ZEnk14TD_pUIVZITE78ZLIVhKH7-wkkynTPBmYMlfg=w640-rw-lo 360w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Beeo_omw_Hsw1blQOJGc9GsA3skqougwqE64LQTT-7F0cvp_6A95y9O-WQ0AbZVfGAJYelJ2ZEnk14TD_pUIVZITE78ZLIVhKH7-wkkynTPBmYMlfg=w768-rw-lo 360w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Beeo_omw_Hsw1blQOJGc9GsA3skqougwqE64LQTT-7F0cvp_6A95y9O-WQ0AbZVfGAJYelJ2ZEnk14TD_pUIVZITE78ZLIVhKH7-wkkynTPBmYMlfg=w1024-rw-lo 360w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Beeo_omw_Hsw1blQOJGc9GsA3skqougwqE64LQTT-7F0cvp_6A95y9O-WQ0AbZVfGAJYelJ2ZEnk14TD_pUIVZITE78ZLIVhKH7-wkkynTPBmYMlfg=w1440-rw-lo 360w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Beeo_omw_Hsw1blQOJGc9GsA3skqougwqE64LQTT-7F0cvp_6A95y9O-WQ0AbZVfGAJYelJ2ZEnk14TD_pUIVZITE78ZLIVhKH7-wkkynTPBmYMlfg=w1728-rw-lo 360w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Beeo_omw_Hsw1blQOJGc9GsA3skqougwqE64LQTT-7F0cvp_6A95y9O-WQ0AbZVfGAJYelJ2ZEnk14TD_pUIVZITE78ZLIVhKH7-wkkynTPBmYMlfg=w2880-rw-lo 360w" alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" height="360" loading="lazy" role="presentation" sizes="auto" width="360"></picture></div></figcaption></figure> </abc-bridge></div><div data-width="full" aria-labelledby="tab-1f60b978-1748-44c8-89a3-b7aab3f8b1f3-7" id="panel-1f60b978-1748-44c8-89a3-b7aab3f8b1f3-7" role="tabpanel"><abc-bridge> <figure data-hydration="client:idle"><div><blockquote><p>“To help legal professionals achieve more with Lexis+ with Protégé, we continuously evaluate AI models as part of the multi-model approach behind the LexisNexis Legal Intelligence Engine. In preliminary evaluations, Gemini 4 Argon demonstrated strong performance across legal knowledge, drafting, and analysis tasks, including identifying relevant citations and improving contract reviews, complaint analyses, and research memos.”</p></blockquote></div><figcaption><div><p>Min Chen</p><p>Chief AI Officer, LexisNexis Legal &amp; Professional</p></div> <div data-has-dark-logo=""><picture><img alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" height="360" loading="lazy" role="presentation" sizes="auto" src="https://storage.googleapis.com/gdm-deepmind-com-prod-public/media/images/BZ-pfongknkKZoid/showcase__lexisnexis__light.width-1440.svg" width="360"></picture><picture><img alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" height="360" loading="lazy" role="presentation" sizes="auto" src="https://storage.googleapis.com/gdm-deepmind-com-prod-public/media/images/-iJnIG-W5J5Kz6hB/showcase__lexisnexis__dark.width-1440.svg" width="360"></picture></div></figcaption></figure> </abc-bridge></div><div data-width="full" aria-labelledby="tab-1f60b978-1748-44c8-89a3-b7aab3f8b1f3-8" id="panel-1f60b978-1748-44c8-89a3-b7aab3f8b1f3-8" role="tabpanel"><abc-bridge> <figure data-hydration="client:idle"><div><blockquote><p>“In early testing, Gemini 4 Argon stood out by connecting dates, documents, and financial calculations with legal precedents to develop highly substantive arguments. In one evaluation, it actually surpassed our human expert's answer key by surfacing a legally relevant detail we had missed. This demonstrates AI’s potential to help professionals uncover crucial details and bring a more complete understanding to complex cases.”</p></blockquote></div><figcaption><div><p>Caio Perona</p><p>CEO, MinutalA</p></div> <div data-has-dark-logo=""><picture><img alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" height="360" loading="lazy" role="presentation" sizes="auto" src="https://storage.googleapis.com/gdm-deepmind-com-prod-public/media/images/DFzKwKRd8hdOfSxY/showcase__minutala__light.width-1440.svg" width="360"></picture><picture><img alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" height="360" loading="lazy" role="presentation" sizes="auto" src="https://storage.googleapis.com/gdm-deepmind-com-prod-public/media/images/lTKTkdcestH7Rm5V/showcase__minutala__dark.width-1440.svg" width="360"></picture></div></figcaption></figure> </abc-bridge></div><div data-width="full" aria-labelledby="tab-1f60b978-1748-44c8-89a3-b7aab3f8b1f3-9" id="panel-1f60b978-1748-44c8-89a3-b7aab3f8b1f3-9" role="tabpanel"><abc-bridge> <figure data-hydration="client:idle"><div><blockquote><p>“In Qualia, our autonomous AI researcher, Gemini 4 Argon has been a standout in our evaluations for both capability and efficiency. On our internal benchmarks of complex, multi-step research tasks, it performs at the frontier while completing our evals 1.5x faster than peer models at a quarter of the cost per task. It excelled at coming up with novel ideas and identifying non-obvious insights about the problem, helping it maintain a clear research vision over long horizons, something today's models struggle with.”</p></blockquote></div><figcaption><div><p>Trenton Chang</p><p>Chief Scientist, Quadrillion</p></div> <div data-has-dark-logo=""><picture><img alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" height="360" loading="lazy" role="presentation" sizes="auto" src="https://storage.googleapis.com/gdm-deepmind-com-prod-public/media/images/SIL0bfcGmAebHsmA/showcase__quadrillion__light.width-1440.svg" width="360"></picture><picture><img alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" height="360" loading="lazy" role="presentation" sizes="auto" src="https://storage.googleapis.com/gdm-deepmind-com-prod-public/media/images/v4tkQhmm-7KXSWaj/showcase__quadrillion__dark.width-1440.svg" width="360"></picture></div></figcaption></figure> </abc-bridge></div><div data-width="full" aria-labelledby="tab-1f60b978-1748-44c8-89a3-b7aab3f8b1f3-10" id="panel-1f60b978-1748-44c8-89a3-b7aab3f8b1f3-10" role="tabpanel"><abc-bridge> <figure data-hydration="client:idle"><div><blockquote><p>“Gemini 4 impressed us with the quality of its responses in our early evaluations. On Poe, people are increasingly using AI to build things, and Gemini 4 gives creators a powerful foundation for turning an idea into a tool they can refine and share.”</p></blockquote></div><figcaption><div><p>Gareth Jones</p><p>Head of Product, Quora</p></div> <div data-has-dark-logo=""><picture><img alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" height="360" loading="lazy" role="presentation" sizes="auto" src="https://storage.googleapis.com/gdm-deepmind-com-prod-public/media/images/OxV4rP5R4-L5JJEr/showcase__quora__light.width-1440.svg" width="360"></picture><picture><img alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" height="360" loading="lazy" role="presentation" sizes="auto" src="https://storage.googleapis.com/gdm-deepmind-com-prod-public/media/images/cUq-unjels2ber-x/showcase__quora__dark.width-1440.svg" width="360"></picture></div></figcaption></figure> </abc-bridge></div><div data-width="full" aria-labelledby="tab-1f60b978-1748-44c8-89a3-b7aab3f8b1f3-11" id="panel-1f60b978-1748-44c8-89a3-b7aab3f8b1f3-11" role="tabpanel"><abc-bridge> <figure data-hydration="client:idle"><div><blockquote><p>“Argon ranked first in our object detection evaluations and led our new text benchmark, which uses real-world images from manufacturing, logistics, and aerial imagery. We’ve fully integrated Argon into Roboflow so developers and enterprises can leverage its high precision detection and text extraction to inspect products, track inventory, and guide machines.”</p></blockquote></div><figcaption><div><p>Brad Dwyer</p><p>Co-founder and CTO of Roboflow</p></div> <div data-has-dark-logo=""><picture><img alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" height="360" loading="lazy" role="presentation" sizes="auto" src="https://storage.googleapis.com/gdm-deepmind-com-prod-public/media/images/zQ3mePCRkxoQ_c5c/showcase__roboflow__light.width-1440.svg" width="360"></picture><picture><img alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" height="360" loading="lazy" role="presentation" sizes="auto" src="https://storage.googleapis.com/gdm-deepmind-com-prod-public/media/images/515WAIr16lt3DScZ/showcase__roboflow__dark.width-1440.svg" width="360"></picture></div></figcaption></figure> </abc-bridge></div></div></div><div id="transforming-critical-business-and-professional-workflows"><section aria-label="Card carousel" aria-roledescription="carousel" data-carousel-breakpoint="xl" id="card-group-carousel-bb3f05b6-a69d-4e04-ba71-146f38872e67" role="region"><p>Slide 1 of 4</p><div><div aria-label="1 of 4" aria-roledescription="slide" role="group"><article><div><figure><figure></figure><figcaption><deepai-caption><p data-block-key="3kvmi">In Gemini App, Argon takes an unstructured folder full of project context and formats it into a clean proposal deck for a client using a custom skill. Gemini then drafts and emails the deck to a client while creating an automated workflow for all future incoming client requests with a scheduled task.</p></deepai-caption></figcaption></figure></div></article></div><div aria-label="2 of 4" aria-roledescription="slide" role="group"><article><div><figure><figure></figure><figcaption><deepai-caption><p data-block-key="3kvmi">See how Argon synthesizes ~50 GB of Airborne LiDAR scans, GIS room vectors, Library of Congress CAD drawings, and NPS archives to reconstruct 3D models of Chaco Canyon, turning fragmented archaeological records into explorable digital heritage sites.</p></deepai-caption></figcaption></figure></div></article></div><div aria-label="3 of 4" aria-roledescription="slide" role="group"><article><div><figure><figure></figure><figcaption><deepai-caption><p data-block-key="3kvmi">Argon using Antigravity in the Gemini macOS app generates design iterations for new legs for a sofa using Nano Banana then generates a 3d printable file for one. Starting from a sketch of the measurements and a photo of the couch Argon builds the model to the correct size to fit the sofa.</p></deepai-caption></figcaption></figure></div></article></div><div aria-label="4 of 4" aria-roledescription="slide" role="group"><article><div><figure><figure></figure><figcaption><deepai-caption><p data-block-key="3kvmi">Replace a broken sofa leg with new 3D printed ones using custom visualizations using Antigravity in the Gemini macOS app.</p></deepai-caption></figcaption></figure></div></article></div></div></section><div><div><article><div><figure><figure></figure><figcaption><deepai-caption><p data-block-key="3kvmi">In Gemini App, Argon takes an unstructured folder full of project context and formats it into a clean proposal deck for a client using a custom skill. Gemini then drafts and emails the deck to a client while creating an automated workflow for all future incoming client requests with a scheduled task.</p></deepai-caption></figcaption></figure></div></article></div><div><article><div><figure><figure></figure><figcaption><deepai-caption><p data-block-key="3kvmi">See how Argon synthesizes ~50 GB of Airborne LiDAR scans, GIS room vectors, Library of Congress CAD drawings, and NPS archives to reconstruct 3D models of Chaco Canyon, turning fragmented archaeological records into explorable digital heritage sites.</p></deepai-caption></figcaption></figure></div></article></div><div><article><div><figure><figure></figure><figcaption><deepai-caption><p data-block-key="3kvmi">Argon using Antigravity in the Gemini macOS app generates design iterations for new legs for a sofa using Nano Banana then generates a 3d printable file for one. Starting from a sketch of the measurements and a photo of the couch Argon builds the model to the correct size to fit the sofa.</p></deepai-caption></figcaption></figure></div></article></div><div><article><div><figure><figure></figure><figcaption><deepai-caption><p data-block-key="3kvmi">Replace a broken sofa leg with new 3D printed ones using custom visualizations using Antigravity in the Gemini macOS app.</p></deepai-caption></figcaption></figure></div></article></div></div></div><div id="speeding-up-robotics-development"><scroller-block>  </scroller-block><div><figure><figcaption><deepai-caption><p data-block-key="dtp0j">To demonstrate these capabilities in action, we tested Argon’s ability to learn an out of distribution physical skill simply by watching. In an internal test, Argon watched a raw video of a human playing cornhole, mapped the spatial coordinates of the environment, and calculated the required whole-body joint movements. It then autonomously built the simulation code. When transferred onto Apptronik’s Apollo humanoid, the robot quickly sank seven consecutive shots in a real-world trial.</p></deepai-caption></figcaption></figure></div></div><div id="gemini-4-argon-with-cybersecurity-defense-capabilities"><scroller-block>  </scroller-block><p data-block-key="g40ht"><span>Wiz is already using Argon for its “Scan for Good” initiative, which protects critical public infrastructure for free. Having had early access to the model, Wiz used Argon to protect critical healthcare infrastructure. The model went beyond just spotting a vulnerability - it proactively safeguarded hundreds of thousands of patient records.</span></p></div><div id="output-window"><scroller-block>  </scroller-block><div><article><div><h3>Uninterrupted frontier math and science derivations</h3><p data-block-key="srum5">With 1M output tokens, Argon has the headroom to finish 100K+ token reasoning trajectories and output exhaustive, step-by-step mathematical proofs, quantum error-correction decoders, and complete computational physics solvers in one go.</p></div></article></div><div><article><div><h3>Full-repository generation and refactoring</h3><p data-block-key="srum5">Generate entire multi-file applications, scaffold complete microservices, or refactor sprawling codebases in a single pass without stitching together truncated responses.</p></div></article></div><div><article><div><h3>Massive legacy translations</h3><p data-block-key="srum5">Translate monolithic legacy files and complex database schemas end-to-end while preserving cross-file dependencies.</p></div></article></div><div><article><div><h3>Exhaustive structured synthesis</h3><p data-block-key="srum5">Produce comprehensive compliance audits, full-scale technical specifications, and massive structured datasets in a single turn.</p></div></article></div></div><div id="performance"><scroller-block>  </scroller-block><div><table><thead><tr><th scope="col"><span>Category</span></th><th scope="col">Benchmark</th><th scope="col"><span>Notes</span></th><th scope="col">Gemini 4 Argon</th><th scope="col">GPT-6 Astra</th><th scope="col">Claude Fable 5.1</th><th scope="col">Claude Opus 5.5</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th rowspan="4" scope="row"><small>Knowledge work</small></th><td>Vals Index</td><td></td><td><strong>68.9%</strong></td><td>63.1%</td><td>65.8%</td><td>67.0%</td></tr><tr><td>AutomationBench</td><td><small>Score</small></td><td><strong>51.3%</strong></td><td>41.4%</td><td>31.4%</td><td>42.5%</td></tr><tr><td>Vals Finance Agent v2</td><td></td><td><strong>65.4%</strong></td><td>53.5%</td><td>58.9%</td><td>58.6%</td></tr><tr><td>Harvey's Legal Agent Benchmark</td><td></td><td><strong>19.6%</strong></td><td>5.4%</td><td>6.7%</td><td>3.8%</td></tr><tr><th rowspan="4" scope="row"><small>Agentic coding</small></th><td>DeepSWE v1.1</td><td></td><td><strong>77.9%</strong></td><td>74.1%</td><td>67.4%</td><td>74.2%</td></tr><tr><td>FrontierSWE v2</td><td></td><td>55.0%</td><td><strong>65.5%</strong></td><td>56.3%</td><td>62.3%</td></tr><tr><td>Vibe Code Bench</td><td></td><td><strong>91.9%</strong></td><td>89.6%</td><td>90.3%</td><td>90.3%</td></tr><tr><td>Terminal-bench 4.0</td><td></td><td>57.4%</td><td>58.2%</td><td>57.9%</td><td><strong>66.4%</strong></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><small>ML engineering</small></th><td>PostTrainBench</td><td></td><td>45.3%</td><td>44.3%</td><td>40.2%</td><td><strong>49.3%</strong></td></tr><tr><th rowspan="3" scope="row"><small>Science and math</small></th><td>Terminal-Bench Science 0.1</td><td></td><td>57.6%</td><td><strong>68.1%</strong></td><td>52.6%</td><td>63.3%</td></tr><tr><td>LABBench 2</td><td></td><td><strong>88.8%</strong></td><td>85.4%</td><td>68.6%</td><td>73.1%</td></tr><tr><td>RiemannBench</td><td></td><td><strong>76.0%</strong></td><td>72.0%</td><td>65.6%</td><td>69.6%</td></tr><tr><th rowspan="2" scope="row"><small>Long context</small></th><td rowspan="2">GraphWalks</td><td><small>Up to 128k, BFS (F1)</small></td><td><strong>99.7%</strong></td><td>98.7%</td><td>91.4%</td><td>90.6%</td></tr><tr><td><small>256k to 1M, BFS (F1)</small></td><td><strong>84.2%</strong></td><td>71.8%</td><td>65.0%</td><td>66.8%</td></tr><tr><th rowspan="2" scope="row"><small>Computer use</small></th><td>Agent's Last Exam</td><td><small>Pass rate</small></td><td><strong>39.5%</strong></td><td>34.2%</td><td>—</td><td>38.2%</td></tr><tr><td>OSWorld-2.0</td><td><small>Offline subset<br>Partial score</small></td><td>69.2%</td><td><strong>72.6%</strong></td><td>—</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><th rowspan="2" scope="row"><small>Multimodal understanding</small></th><td>Chartography</td><td></td><td><strong>71.6%</strong></td><td>71.0%</td><td>46.2%</td><td>66.3%</td></tr><tr><td>LVBench</td><td></td><td><strong>91.7%</strong></td><td>87.5%</td><td>79.7%</td><td>83.7%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><small>Cybersecurity</small></th><td>CWE-bench v1</td><td></td><td><strong>68.0%</strong></td><td><strong>68.0%</strong></td><td>58.0%</td><td>67.0%</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div id="safety"><scroller-block>  </scroller-block><div><div><article><div><h3>Defending against misuse</h3><p data-block-key="srum5">Argon is designed to refuse harmful requests while preserving legitimate, dual-use scientific research, as per our Frontier Safety Framework.</p></div></article></div><div><article><div><h3>Defending against prompt injection attacks</h3><p data-block-key="dkv1g">Argon is our most resilient model yet against indirect prompt injections.</p></div></article></div></div><div><div><article><div><h3>Monitoring for misalignment</h3><p data-block-key="srum5">We are deploying misalignment mitigations that monitor Argon’s chain-of-thought and actions and stop execution when necessary.</p></div></article></div><div><article><div><h3>Hardening systems</h3><p data-block-key="dkv1g">We are hardening our sandboxed environments by isolating and sealing them before high-risk training or evaluations begin.</p></div></article></div></div></div><div id="built-with-argon"><p><h2 data-block-key="0q9hx"><span>Built with Argon</span></h2></p></div><div id="google-ai-ultra-and-research-programs"><div><article><div><h3>Gemini 4 Argon is available today for Google AI Pro and Ultra subscribers</h3><p data-block-key="vio4p">Our flagship subscription tier, giving power users, developers, and creators highest access to advanced features and capabilities across Google to accelerate their workflows.</p></div></article></div><div><article><div><h3>Apply for research and security programs</h3><p data-block-key="vio4p">Academic and independent scientists can apply to get the highest usage tier in Google Antigravity free of charge for 6 months (subject to eligibility, capacity, and selection) and cybersecurity defenders can apply to join the Fairwind Program.</p></div></article></div></div><div id="try-gemini-4-argon"><div><article><div><h3>Gemini</h3><p data-block-key="a6pjg">Supercharge your creativity and productivity </p></div></article></div><div><article><div><h3>AI Mode</h3><p data-block-key="a6pjg">Ask whatever's on your mind to get an AI powered response</p></div></article></div><div><article><div><h3>Google Antigravity</h3><p data-block-key="a6pjg">Our agent-first development platform that allows anyone to be a builder</p></div></article></div><div><article><div><h3>Google AI Studio</h3><p data-block-key="a6pjg">The fastest path from prompt to production</p></div></article></div><div><article><div><h3>Gemini API</h3><p data-block-key="a6pjg">Get started building with cutting-edge models </p></div></article></div><div><article><div><h3>Gemini platform</h3><p data-block-key="a6pjg">Build, deploy, and govern enterprise-ready agents and apps</p></div></article></div><div><article><div><h3>Android Studio</h3><p data-block-key="a6pjg">The official IDE for Android app development</p></div></article></div></div><div id="ecosystem"><section aria-label="Card carousel" aria-roledescription="carousel" data-carousel-breakpoint="xl" id="card-group-carousel-cd135db9-7f76-44dd-963a-1e49e1549a7a" role="region"><p>Slide 1 of 4</p><div><div aria-label="1 of 4" aria-roledescription="slide" role="group"><article><div><h3>Gemini Omni</h3><p data-block-key="k1mzh">Create anything from anything, starting with video</p></div></article></div><div aria-label="2 of 4" aria-roledescription="slide" role="group"><article><div><h3>Nano Banana</h3><p data-block-key="k1mzh">Create and edit images with Gemini</p></div></article></div><div aria-label="3 of 4" aria-roledescription="slide" role="group"><article><div><h3>Gemini Audio</h3><p data-block-key="k1mzh">Push new frontiers with intuitive inputs, natural expressiveness, and the ability to take action</p></div></article></div><div aria-label="4 of 4" aria-roledescription="slide" role="group"><article><div><h3>Gemini Robotics</h3><p data-block-key="k1mzh">The intelligence layer to power any kind of robot</p></div></article></div></div></section><div><div><article><div><h3>Gemini Omni</h3><p data-block-key="k1mzh">Create anything from anything, starting with video</p></div></article></div><div><article><div><h3>Nano Banana</h3><p data-block-key="k1mzh">Create and edit images with Gemini</p></div></article></div><div><article><div><h3>Gemini Audio</h3><p data-block-key="k1mzh">Push new frontiers with intuitive inputs, natural expressiveness, and the ability to take action</p></div></article></div><div><article><div><h3>Gemini Robotics</h3><p data-block-key="k1mzh">The intelligence layer to power any kind of robot</p></div></article></div></div></div></div></div>]]></description>
