        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[Apple HomeView (370 pts)]]></title>
            <link>https://www.apple.com/apple-homeview/</link>
            <guid>50071017</guid>
            <pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 13:02:12 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>URL: <a href="https://www.apple.com/apple-homeview/">https://www.apple.com/apple-homeview/</a>, See on <a href="https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50071017">Hacker News</a></p>
<div id="readability-page-1" class="page"><div id="main" role="main" data-page-type="overview">
		
		
		<section data-anim-scroll-group="Product Viewer" data-deep-link="product-viewer" data-analytics-section-engagement="name:product viewer" data-component-list="StaggeredFadeIn ProductViewerAnimation" data-ric-section="">
			
			
			<figure data-anim-lazy-image=""></figure>
			<figure data-anim-lazy-image=""></figure>
		</section>
		
		
		<section data-anim-scroll-group="Siri Ai" data-analytics-section-engagement="name:siri ai" data-component-list="StaggeredFadeIn" data-ric-section="">
			<div>
					<h2 data-focus-expression="{&quot;expression&quot;:&quot;t - 50vh + 50h&quot;,&quot;focus-delay&quot;:true}">
						<span data-staggered-item="">Meet Siri&nbsp;AI.<br> Your AI assistant.<br>More personal. <br>More powerful.</span>
					</h2>
					<div data-staggered-item="" data-focus-expression="{&quot;expression&quot;:&quot;t - 50vh + 50h&quot;,&quot;focus-delay&quot;:true}">
						<p>Siri&nbsp;AI, powered by Apple&nbsp;Intelligence, comes built into Apple&nbsp;HomeView to help you find what you need and get more done while protecting your privacy.<sup data-footnote="numbered-siri-ai"><a href="#footnote-2" aria-label="Footnote 1" data-modal-close="">1</a></sup> Siri&nbsp;AI adapts to each person and surfaces what matters most to them — all they have to do is&nbsp;ask.<br></p>
						<p>Available in English to start.<br>Usage limits may apply.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			<div id="siri-ai-gallery" data-has-captions="" data-initial-index="0" data-analytics-gallery-id="siri ai gallery" data-auto-play-off="false" data-auto-play-active-item="" data-component-list="FadeGallery">
						<div id="siri-ai-gallery-gallery-item-0" data-analytics-gallery-item-id="personal context" data-ac-gallery-item="0" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="siri-ai-gallery-tab-0">
							
							<p>Personal Context</p>
							<div id="siri-ai-gallery-gallery-caption-0" data-captions-gallery-item="" data-hidden-until-found="">
									<h3>Relevant to you.</h3>
									<p>Pull up a party invitation from your calendar, find RSVPs buried in your messages, or play the perfect soundtrack to match the vibe. Siri&nbsp;AI works with your paired iPhone or iPad to find relevant content just for&nbsp;you.<sup data-footnote="numbered-siri-ai"><a href="#footnote-2" aria-label="Footnote 1" data-modal-close="">1</a></sup></p>
								</div>
						</div>
						<div id="siri-ai-gallery-gallery-item-1" data-analytics-gallery-item-id="world knowledge" data-ac-gallery-item="1" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="siri-ai-gallery-tab-1">
							
							<p>World Knowledge</p>
							<div id="siri-ai-gallery-gallery-caption-1" data-captions-gallery-item="" data-hidden-until-found="">
									<h3>Your little brainiac.</h3>
									<p>Ask about virtually any topic, from quick dinner recipes to DIY home repairs to game-night trivia. Siri&nbsp;AI taps into broad world knowledge to give you highly specific, up-to-date answers.</p>
								</div>
						</div>
						<div id="siri-ai-gallery-gallery-item-2" data-analytics-gallery-item-id="seamless experience" data-ac-gallery-item="2" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="siri-ai-gallery-tab-2">
							
							<p>Seamless Experience</p>
							<div id="siri-ai-gallery-gallery-caption-2" data-captions-gallery-item="" data-hidden-until-found="">
									<h3>Carries the conversation.</h3>
									<p>Siri&nbsp;AI lets you ask open-ended questions and go back and forth with natural, rich conversations. And your conversations with Siri on HomeView sync to the Siri app on your other Apple devices so you can pick up where you left&nbsp;off.</p>
								</div>
						</div>
					</div>
		</section>
		
		<div data-anim-scroll-group="Cooking" data-analytics-section-engagement="name:help at home" data-ric-section="">
				<div data-component-list="StaggeredFadeIn">
						<h2 data-focus-expression="{&quot;expression&quot;:&quot;t - 50vh + 50h&quot;,&quot;focus-delay&quot;:true}">
							<span data-staggered-item="">Heaps of help at&nbsp;home.</span>
						</h2>
						<p>Apple&nbsp;HomeView does the heavy lifting when you’re busy around the house. Check your calendar, set reminders, and stay on top of your to-do list. Pull up a quick crafting tutorial. Ask Siri&nbsp;AI to recommend a new coffee shop. Start and stop multiple timers for your chores, and keep an eye on them with Live&nbsp;Activities when you’re using other&nbsp;apps.</p>
					</div>
				
				<div data-component-list="StaggeredFadeIn">
						<div data-staggered-item="">
								<h3>Cooking.</h3>
								<p>When you find a recipe in Safari, just tap the Start Cooking button to view a streamlined format that’s easy to&nbsp;follow.</p>
							</div>
						<div data-staggered-item="">
								<h3>Handoff.</h3>
								<p>Start a song, podcast, call, video, or recipe on iPhone, and continue on HomeView without missing a&nbsp;beat.</p>
							</div>
					</div>
			</div>
		<section data-anim-scroll-group="Entertainment" data-analytics-section-engagement="name:entertainment" data-ric-section="">
			<div data-component-list="StaggeredFadeIn">
						<div data-staggered-item="">
								<h3>Apple apps.</h3>
								<p>A selection of Apple apps are available on HomeView. Enjoy Music with lyrics and artwork,<sup data-footnote="numbered-apple-music"><a href="#footnote-8" aria-label="Footnote 7" data-modal-close="">7</a></sup> audio stories on News<sup data-footnote="numbered-apple-news"><a href="#footnote-9" aria-label="Footnote 8" data-modal-close="">8</a></sup> and Audiobooks, and so much&nbsp;more.</p>
							</div>
						<div data-staggered-item="">
								<h3>Additional apps.</h3>
								<p>HomeView supports compatible third-party audio and video apps from your iPhone for a familiar experience across devices.<sup data-footnote="numbered-subscription"><a href="#footnote-10" aria-label="Footnote 9" data-modal-close="">9</a></sup></p>
							</div>
					</div>
			<div data-callout-anchor="">
					<div data-component-list="VideoScrub" aria-label="Animation of Apple HomeView, two devices, rotating counter-clockwise from side exterior to front exterior, then zooming in on exterior speaker grille, from left to right, rose pink color, displaying Music app album artwork, starlight color (pale gold), showing artwork from the Apple TV series Pluribus" role="img">
							<picture id="overview-entertainment-entertainment-startframe-1" data-lazy="" data-download-area-keyframe="{&quot;start&quot;: &quot;t - 150vh&quot;, &quot;end&quot;: &quot;b&quot;, &quot;disabledWhen&quot;: &quot;no-enhanced&quot;}">
								<source data-empty="" srcset="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAHAAACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==" media="(min-width:0px)">
								<img src="https://www.apple.com/v/apple-homeview/a/images/overview/entertainment/entertainment_startframe__e5dn96s1qwia_large.jpg" onload="window.__lp?.(event)" alt="">
							</picture>
							
						</div>
					<div>
								<div>
										<h3>Apple apps.</h3>
										<p>A selection of Apple apps are available on HomeView. Enjoy Music with lyrics and artwork,<sup data-footnote="numbered-apple-music"><a href="#footnote-8" aria-label="Footnote 7" data-modal-close="">7</a></sup> audio stories on News<sup data-footnote="numbered-apple-news"><a href="#footnote-9" aria-label="Footnote 8" data-modal-close="">8</a></sup> and Audiobooks, and so much&nbsp;more.</p>
									</div>
								<div>
										<h3>Additional apps.</h3>
										<p>HomeView supports compatible third-party audio and video apps from your iPhone for a familiar experience across devices.<sup data-footnote="numbered-subscription"><a href="#footnote-10" aria-label="Footnote 9" data-modal-close="">9</a></sup></p>
									</div>
							</div>
				</div>
			<div data-staggered-item="" data-component-list="StaggeredFadeIn">
								<h3>Astounding sound.</h3>
								<p>The mighty yet compact speakers pack a serious punch. Two custom full-range drivers in the display keep everything sounding crisp and clean while delivering room-filling Spatial&nbsp;Audio.<sup data-footnote="numbered-spatial-audio"><a href="#footnote-5" aria-label="Footnote 4" data-modal-close="">4</a></sup> Computational audio adjusts consistency and balance in real time to deliver incredible sound every time, from anywhere. And a down-firing woofer and two force-cancelling passive radiators are built into the base — for deep, rich&nbsp;bass.</p>
							</div>
			<div data-component-list="StaggeredFadeIn">
					<div data-staggered-item="">
							<h3>Spatial&nbsp;Audio.</h3>
							<p>Fills the room with rich, textured sound for a high-fidelity listening experience.<sup data-footnote="numbered-spatial-audio"><a href="#footnote-5" aria-label="Footnote 4" data-modal-close="">4</a></sup></p>
						</div>
					<div data-staggered-item="">
							<h3>Multiroom audio.</h3>
							<p>Use AirPlay to connect with HomePod, Apple&nbsp;TV&nbsp;4K, and compatible speakers — and just like that, you have a fully connected home sound&nbsp;system.<sup data-footnote="numbered-multiroom"><a href="#footnote-11" aria-label="Footnote 10" data-modal-close="">10</a></sup></p>
						</div>
				</div>
		</section>
		<div data-anim-scroll-group="Facetime" data-analytics-section-engagement="name:facetime" data-ric-section="">
				<div data-component-list="StaggeredFadeIn">
					<div>
						<h2 data-focus-expression="{&quot;expression&quot;:&quot;t - 50vh + 50h&quot;,&quot;focus-delay&quot;:true}">
							<span data-staggered-item="">Friends and family are&nbsp;just a screen away.</span>
						</h2>
						<p>Whether you’re calling a friend abroad or calling the kids for dinner, Apple&nbsp;HomeView brings everyone together. Enjoy clear and hands-free FaceTime calls. Use Intercom on HomeView and HomePod speakers to communicate with people throughout the house or on their personal devices like iPhone, iPad, or Apple&nbsp;Watch. Send messages and make phone calls using just your voice. And use Find&nbsp;My to help you locate your devices, personal items that have an AirTag, and anybody who chooses to share their location with&nbsp;you.</p>
					</div>
					<div>
						<div data-staggered-item="">
								<h3>Center&nbsp;Stage</h3>
								<p>keeps everyone in the frame during FaceTime calls, even as they move around or if more people join&nbsp;in.</p>
							</div>
						<div data-staggered-item="">
								<h3>The four-microphone array</h3>
								<p>picks up voices while reducing background noise, for clear calls and Siri&nbsp;requests.</p>
							</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div>
					<picture id="overview-entertainment-facetime-1" data-lazy="">
						<source data-empty="" srcset="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAHAAACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==" media="(min-width:0px)">
						<img src="https://www.apple.com/v/apple-homeview/a/images/overview/entertainment/facetime__ezjuacbus9ci_large.jpg" onload="window.__lp?.(event)" alt="Apple HomeView, screen shows a FaceTime video call with a woman and child in a kitchen, and an older woman waving in the inset window">
					</picture>
					
				</div>
			</div>
		<div data-anim-scroll-group="Smart Home" data-analytics-section-engagement="name:home app" data-ric-section="">
				<div data-anim-scroll-group="Smart Home type-lockup-intro" data-component-list="StaggeredFadeIn">
					<h2 data-focus-expression="{&quot;expression&quot;:&quot;t - 50vh + 50h&quot;,&quot;focus-delay&quot;:true}">
						<span data-staggered-item="">Everything<br> connected<p> and under one roof.</p></span>
					</h2>
					<p>Apple&nbsp;HomeView is a central hub for your smart home accessories, making it easy to keep things running smoothly. And with the new Apple&nbsp;Home&nbsp;Collection, it’s never been simpler to set up and control a connected&nbsp;home.</p>
				</div>
				<div>
					<picture id="overview-smart-home-smart-home-hw-1" data-lazy="">
						<source data-empty="" srcset="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAHAAACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==" media="(min-width:0px)">
						<img src="https://www.apple.com/v/apple-homeview/a/images/overview/smart-home/smart_home_hw__66egwn7k20i2_xlarge.jpg" onload="window.__lp?.(event)" alt="Apple HomeView, wall-mounted model on a wall, silver color, displaying time, temperature, front door camera feed, and controls for thermostat, bedroom fan, door lock, and lights">
					</picture>
					
				</div>
				<div data-component-list="StaggeredFadeIn" data-staggered-item="">
						<picture id="overview-smart-home-app-icon-1" data-lazy="">
							<source data-empty="" srcset="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAHAAACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==" media="(min-width:0px)">
							<img src="https://www.apple.com/v/apple-homeview/a/images/overview/smart-home/app_icon__c90r56lgtseq_large.png" onload="window.__lp?.(event)" alt="">
						</picture>
						
					</div>
				<div data-component-list="StaggeredFadeIn">
					<h3 data-focus-expression="{&quot;expression&quot;:&quot;t - 50vh + 50h&quot;,&quot;focus-delay&quot;:true}">
						<span data-staggered-item="">Integrated with the Home&nbsp;app.</span>
					</h3>
					<p>Built into HomeView and synced with your other Apple devices, the Home&nbsp;app keeps you on top of your smart home. See who’s at the door, monitor your entryway, access multiple video feeds, adjust the lighting and temperature, and control scenes and automations to fit the routines and rhythms of your household.<sup data-footnote="numbered-home-app-home-kit"><a href="#footnote-12" aria-label="Footnote 11" data-modal-close="">11</a></sup></p>
					
				</div>
				<div data-component-list="StaggeredFadeIn">
						<div data-staggered-item="">
								<h3>See it all at a glance.</h3>
								<p>The Home&nbsp;Modular face gives you a clear and concise look at your home accessories, while the Home&nbsp;Camera face lets you stream up to nine videos at the same time. And you can manage it all with just your voice or a&nbsp;tap.</p>
							</div>
						<div data-staggered-item="">
								<h3>Enjoy peace of mind.</h3>
								<p>HomeView can detect the sounds of the smoke and carbon monoxide detectors in your home and alert you on your iPhone, iPad, or Apple&nbsp;Watch.</p>
							</div>
						<div data-staggered-item="">
								<h3>Stay caught up.</h3>
								<p>The Home&nbsp;app uses Apple&nbsp;Intelligence to group related notifications together, such as when a family member arrives home, unlocks the door, and disables the alarm. And with descriptions of video footage, you can use HomeView to catch up on key activity in and around the&nbsp;house.</p>
							</div>
					</div>
			</div>
		
		<div data-component-list="StaggeredFadeIn" data-anim-scroll-group="Data Privacy" data-analytics-section-engagement="name:data privacy" data-ric-section="">
								<div data-staggered-item="">
										<h3>Multiple users.</h3>
										<p>HomeView can recognize up to six people and seamlessly switch between them. It&nbsp;syncs with each user’s iPhone or iPad and is designed to show their content only when they’re using&nbsp;HomeView.<sup data-footnote="numbered-multiuser"><a href="#footnote-13" aria-label="Footnote 12" data-modal-close="">12</a></sup></p>
									</div>
								<div data-staggered-item="">
										<h3>Secure Exclaves.</h3>
										<p>The A18 chip inside HomeView contains Secure Exclaves that process the camera and microphone feeds in a secure compartment that cannot be accessed by the operating system or by Apple. This enables HomeView to recognize the face and voice of each user without exposing the audio and visual data used for recognition to the operating system.</p>
									</div>
								<div data-staggered-item="">
										<h3>Personal content.</h3>
										<p>Users can access their personal content on HomeView when their paired iPhone or iPad is connected to the same Wi-Fi network and has been recently unlocked, and HomeView recognizes the person by&nbsp;face.</p>
									</div>
							</div>
		
		
		<div data-staggered-item="" data-anim-scroll-group="Faq" data-analytics-section-engagement="name:faq" data-component-list="StaggeredFadeIn" data-ric-section="">
						
						<ul id="faq-accordion" data-accordion="" role="list" data-component-list="AccordionLockup">
							<li data-accordion-item="accordion-item-faq-accordion-item1">
								<h3>
									
								</h3>
								<div data-accordion-content="" id="accordion-item-faq-accordion-item1-tray" aria-labelledby="accordion-item-faq-accordion-item1-button" role="region" data-accordion-tray="">
												<p>HomeView is deeply integrated within the Apple ecosystem and features a stunning 7-inch Liquid&nbsp;Retina display and Apple‑engineered audio. Because multiple people can use HomeView, it is designed to keep everyone’s personal information separate.</p>
												<p>Users can access their personal content like Messages and Calendar on HomeView when their paired iPhone or iPad is connected to the same Wi-Fi network and has been recently unlocked, and HomeView recognizes the person by face.</p>
												<p>The A18 chip inside HomeView contains Secure Exclaves that process the camera and microphone feeds in a secure compartment that cannot be accessed by the operating system or by Apple. This enables HomeView to recognize the face and voice of each user without exposing the audio and visual data to the operating system.</p>
											</div>
							</li>
							<li data-accordion-item="accordion-item-faq-accordion-item2">
								<h3>
									
								</h3>
								<div data-accordion-content="" id="accordion-item-faq-accordion-item2-tray" aria-labelledby="accordion-item-faq-accordion-item2-button" role="region" data-accordion-tray="">
												<p>HomeView delivers room-filling sound with support for Spatial&nbsp;Audio, making it a great way to enjoy music and podcasts at home. Its custom-engineered acoustic system combines a down-firing woofer and two full-range drivers to produce deep bass and crisp highs. Powered by the A18 chip and built-in sensors, computational audio continuously optimizes the loudness and bass response at any volume. </p>
												<p>HomeView (Wall&nbsp;Mounted) brings full, balanced sound with two custom drivers and computational audio tuned specifically for on-wall placement, along with support for Spatial Audio.</p>
											</div>
							</li>
							<li data-accordion-item="accordion-item-faq-accordion-item3">
								<h3>
									
								</h3>
								<div data-accordion-content="" id="accordion-item-faq-accordion-item3-tray" aria-labelledby="accordion-item-faq-accordion-item3-button" role="region" data-accordion-tray="">
											<p>HomeView will be available on <a href="https://www.apple.com/" data-analytics-title="apple.com">apple.com</a>, in the Apple&nbsp;Store app, and from select partners. You can see it in person at all Apple&nbsp;Store locations. You can also book a session to shop with a Specialist in-store or online. <a href="https://contactretail.apple.com/?pg=COM:/tv-home&amp;ap=COM&amp;c=us&amp;l=en&amp;ag=FASTPASS" aria-label="Learn more about where to buy Apple HomeView" data-analytics-title="shop with a specialist in-store online"><span>Learn more</span></a>. <br>Subject to availability by partner.</p>
										</div>
							</li>
							<li data-accordion-item="accordion-item-faq-accordion-item4">
								<h3>
									
								</h3>
								<div data-accordion-content="" id="accordion-item-faq-accordion-item4-tray" aria-labelledby="accordion-item-faq-accordion-item4-button" role="region" data-accordion-tray="">
											<p>HomeView is powered by Apple&nbsp;Intelligence. It features Siri&nbsp;AI — a more personal and powerful AI assistant powered by the A18 chip. With broad world knowledge, anyone in the home can ask Siri about virtually any topic. When paired with an Apple&nbsp;Intelligence-enabled iPhone or iPad, Siri can do even more for each recognized user, like taking action across apps and drawing on personal context to help with everyday tasks.</p>
										</div>
							</li>
							<li data-accordion-item="accordion-item-faq-accordion-item5">
								<h3>
									
								</h3>
								<div data-accordion-content="" id="accordion-item-faq-accordion-item5-tray" aria-labelledby="accordion-item-faq-accordion-item5-button" role="region" data-accordion-tray="">
											<p>To unlock a full, personalized experience on HomeView, users need an Apple&nbsp;Account, a compatible iPhone or iPad, and to be added as a member of the shared home in the Home app. However, guests and unrecognized users can still easily interact with HomeView to control smart home accessories, check the weather, set timers, and play music — all without accessing anyone’s personal information.</p>
										</div>
							</li>
							<li data-accordion-item="accordion-item-faq-accordion-item6">
								<h3>
									
								</h3>
								<div data-accordion-content="" id="accordion-item-faq-accordion-item6-tray" aria-labelledby="accordion-item-faq-accordion-item6-button" role="region" data-accordion-tray="">
											<p>Thousands of smart home accessories are compatible with HomeView and Apple&nbsp;Home products. Just look for the Works with Apple&nbsp;Home logo. Lights, locks, cameras, and much more are available. You can also automate many tasks and control all your accessories from the Home app on your Apple&nbsp;devices.</p>
											<div>
												<ul>
													<li>
														<a href="https://www.apple.com/home/accessories/" data-analytics-title="learn more about home accessories" aria-label="Learn more, home accessories"><span>Learn more</span></a>
													</li>
												</ul>
											</div>
										</div>
							</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
		
	</div></div>]]></description>
