            <pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 00:11:04 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>URL: <a href="https://github.com/bherbruck/solidcraft">https://github.com/bherbruck/solidcraft</a>, See on <a href="https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50064840">Hacker News</a></p>
<div id="readability-page-1" class="page"><div data-hpc="true" containertiming="hpc"><article itemprop="text">
<p dir="auto"><strong>An open-source parametric 3D CAD application built in pure Rust.</strong></p>
<p dir="auto">Sketch, constrain, and build solids with a parametric feature timeline. Change a dimension
and watch your model rebuild. Run it on your desktop, in your browser, or let AI agents
model through the built-in MCP server.</p>
<p dir="auto"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://github.com/bherbruck/solidcraft/blob/main/docs/screenshots/demo-0.8.gif"><img src="https://github.com/bherbruck/solidcraft/raw/main/docs/screenshots/demo-0.8.gif" alt="SolidCraft 0.8: model a Raspberry Pi 4 case from an empty design: a sketch dimensioned with parameters, extrude, fillets and shell, a rim rounded in one pick, standoffs patterned on the board's mounting holes, port cut-outs, vent slots, &quot;Pi 4&quot; engraved in a font, a PETG material with its mass in Properties, and a height change in Parameters" data-animated-image=""></a></p>
<p dir="auto"><em>A Raspberry Pi 4 case from an empty design: a sketch dimensioned with the board's parameters, extrude, fillet, shell, the rim rounded in one pick, an M2.5 standoff patterned on the 58 × 49 mm hole rectangle, port cut-outs, vent slots, "Pi 4" engraved in DejaVu Sans Bold and a PETG material defined in the design, with its mass in Properties, then height 24 → 32 mm in Parameters and it all rebuilds. 9× playback. <a href="https://github.com/bherbruck/solidcraft/raw/refs/heads/main/docs/screenshots/demo-0.8.mp4">Full video</a>, recorded with the <a href="https://github.com/bherbruck/solidcraft/blob/main/examples/demo/record_ui.sh">demo script</a>.</em></p>
