<ul dir="auto">
<li><strong>Windows:</strong> download and run the <a href="https://github.com/bherbruck/solidcraft/releases/latest/download/solidcraft-windows-x64.msi">installer</a>.
Also for <a href="https://github.com/bherbruck/solidcraft/releases/latest/download/solidcraft-windows-arm64.msi">ARM64</a> and <a href="https://github.com/bherbruck/solidcraft/releases/latest/download/solidcraft-windows-x86.msi">32-bit</a> PCs, or as a
