With Snap: <code>sudo snap install solidcraft</code> (<a href="https://snapcraft.io/solidcraft" rel="nofollow">Snap Store</a>, or the <a href="https://github.com/bherbruck/solidcraft/releases/latest/download/solidcraft-linux-x86_64.snap">.snap file</a>).
